{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39828","headline":"览陆龟蒙旧集 · 殷文圭","name":"览陆龟蒙旧集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"先生文价沸三吴，白雪千编酒一壶。\n吟去星辰笔下动，醉来嵩华眼中无。\n峭如谢桧虬蟠活，清似缑山凤路孤。\n身後独遗封禅草，何人寻得佐鸿图。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷文圭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39828.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39828","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}